      "text": "\n\nThe tour uses GS1250 motorcycles or equivalent models. The eight-day rental includes insurance. Fuel, road tolls, parking and a separate luggage van are also included in the price. The tour is accompanied by an English-speaking guide and interpreter and a separate English-speaking motorcycle guide.\n"
